KEN\n            - name: N8N_RUNNERS_TASK_BROKER_URI\n              value: \"http://n8n:5679\"\n          resources:\n            requests:\n              cpu: 250m\n              memory: 256Mi\n            limits:\n              cpu: 1000m\n              memory: 1Gi\n          securityContext:\n            allowPrivilegeEscalation: false\n            capabilities:\n              drop:\n                - ALL\n            seccompProfile:\n              type: RuntimeDefault\n```",
